To have a complete series of minor keys, 28 instead of 30 tones to the octave would be enough. They would suffice for the 12 minor keys of *A₁*, *E₁*, *B₁*, *F₁*♯ or *G*♭, *C₁*♯ or *D*♭, *G₁*♯ or @@R1@@
>>>
