 Seventh. The other minor keys have both.—*Translator.*]

Footnote: † [As Prof. Helmholtz has retained this Appendix in his 4th German edition it is given in the translation. But the scheme ¶ explained has never been tried. The plan for 24 notes is @@R1@@
